{"id": "EUVD-2026-102984", "enisaUuid": "f144628a-568f-39c9-a180-51094944acd0", "description": "DataBuff ai-apm-web through 0.1.10 contains a hard-coded default credentials vulnerability that allows unauthenticated attackers to gain administrator access using the built-in admin/Databuff@123 account. Attackers can POST these credentials to /webapi/api/v1/auth/login to obtain an administrator token and access all protected /webapi routes.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:39:48", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T17:39:48", "baseScore": 9.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/databuff-default-jwt-secret-auth-bypass", "https://github.com/databufflabs/databuff/blob/v0.1.10/ai-apm-web/src/main/java/com/databuff/apm/web/admin/account/PortalUserManagementService.java#L14-L31", "https://github.com/databufflabs/databuff", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/databuff-ai-apm-web-through-0.1.10-hard-coded-default-admin-credentials"], "aliases": ["GHSA-4hh4-c7m4-34wx", "CVE-2026-111693"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.38, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "fe08d631-c841-3f05-b5c2-0ffa23d06dd1", "product": {"name": "databuff", "vendor": {"name": "databufflabs"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.1.10"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "2e0950f8-0205-3b2d-bdd7-90bf6cea577a", "vendor": {"name": "databufflabs"}}], "isExploited": false}